{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0b33bac9-f669-8ddf-9c1c-994b614a8ebd",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T13:06:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ileana Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. My name is Ileana Salazar. I'm calling because I need to get a certified copy of a death certificate, and I wanted to know how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Is the person someone who passed here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, she passed at the hospital there in Newport, back in the spring. I work at a title company, and the attorney I work for needs the certified copy for a property file. So it's for work, not family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Those come up with estates and closings all the time. Do you have the full name and the approximate date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the full name and the date, yes. Let me grab the folder. Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, hon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, I'm back. I had to move a jar off the folder. I've got a batch of kombucha brewing in the pantry and it's taking over the shelf."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, as long as it's not leaking on your paperwork. So, go ahead with the name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Margaret Ellen Doyle, D-O-Y-L-E, and the date of death was April ninth of this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Margaret Ellen Doyle, April ninth. Now, for a certified death record, we do need to know your relationship or your reason for requesting it. Since you're requesting on behalf of the attorney, you'd want to bring something showing that, like a letter from the attorney's office on letterhead, plus your own photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A letter from the attorney, on the firm letterhead. I can do that. Does it have to be the attorney who comes in, or can I come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can come in, as long as you have the letter and your ID. We're open until four-thirty today, and tomorrow's a regular day too, but Thursday is New Year's Day so we'll be closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Then I'll come in tomorrow morning. How long does it take once I'm there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the record's on file here and everything's in order, usually you walk out with it the same visit. It shouldn't be long at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And just so I have it straight, the letter, my photo ID, and the name and date I gave you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If anything's off with the record, we'll let you know at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:05:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all I needed. Thank you, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ileana. Happy New Year, see you tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T13:06:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
